⭐ Interview Tip

For Next Greater Element II, the only extra challenge compared to Next Greater Element I is the circular array. The standard trick is to iterate from 2*n - 1 down to 0 and access elements using nums[i % n]. Combined with a monotonic decreasing stack, this gives the optimal O(n) solution.
